hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"20872","Abd al-Rahman ibn Mahdi narrated to us, Mansur ibn Sa'd narrated to us, from Budayl, from Abdullah ibn Shaqiq, from Maysarah al-Fajr, he said: I said: O Messenger of Allah, when were you written as a prophet? He said: While Adam, upon him be peace, was between the soul and the body."
